    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Capture high‑resolution photos and a video walkthrough of the car’s exterior, interior, and undercarriage. Use a checklist app to log scratches, dents, and tire wear. This digital record protects you against disputes and aligns with the standards of reputable car transport cost providers.</p>
