    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One‑quarter tank fuel regulation</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Reduce fuel to approximately 25 % of tank capacity. This minimizes weight, reduces fire risk, and complies with most carrier policies, including those for mumbai to bangalore bus parcel charges that limit liquid volumes.</p>
