    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag management</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Ensure the vehicle’s FASTag is active, linked to a valid account, and positioned correctly on the windshield. Verify that the tag’s balance can cover tolls across the entire route, preventing delays for the driver handling your car transport Bangalore service.</p>
